  "description": "ReDoc 3 for ASP.NET Core: middleware and endpoint routing that serve an embedded ReDoc 3 bundle from your own app, with a picker for multiple OpenAPI documents, per-page authorization, long-lived cache headers and a page that needs no inline script. No dependency on Redoc.AspNetCore or Swashbuckle. For adding a dark theme to one of those hosts instead, install Hlibz.Redoc.Extensions.Swashbuckle or Hlibz.Redoc.Extensions.RedocAspNetCore.",
